    "body": "I’ll test the four DIN/ISO programs on our iTNC 530 programming station first. The station runs NC software `606425 004 SP20`. Our physical Fehlmann Picomax 55 runs `340490-03`.\n\nI’ll report the station result for each file, including the block and the control message if the station rejects it. I can run the programs on the Fehlmann later to check them on `340490-03`.\n",
