    "body": "I tested the four DIN/ISO files from `c5f4e6f94` on our iTNC 530 programming station. It runs NC software `606425 004 SP20`. I used the original bytes and loaded each file as `VMC_3-AXIS.I` in a separate folder.\n\n| Program | Station result |\n| --- | --- |\n| `drill_peck` | The station marked `N100 G205` with `ERROR =` on import. A repeat gave the same result. Changing only `Q208=FMAX` to `Q208=+60` in a diagnostic copy let the station read the full block. I filed #3102 for the post defect. |\n| `tap_plate` | All 17 lines matched on readback. Test Run reached `STOP REASON: block END PGM or M02`. |\n| `contour_plate_with_hole` | All 78 lines matched on readback. Test Run reached the same program end. |\n| `pocket_zigzag_plate_with_island` | The importer returned exit code 1. Readback showed `N990` followed by the program footer. The first missing block was `N1000`. This is consistent with the demo station’s 100-block limit. The full 116-line program still needs a test. |\n\nThe tapping and contour logs identified the selected programs and recorded no numbered alarm. Both graphics panes stayed blank and showed `ERROR`. These runs confirm NC program completion. Stock removal remains unverified.\n\nI can repeat the tests later on the physical Fehlmann Picomax 55. Its control runs `340490-03`.\n",
