    "body": "@qsmits - thank you for the station runs on Nov 21. Here is a short follow-up kit, all generated by `heidenhain.cps` (DIN/ISO) from today's `main` at `edcbfe4dd`. These are the post's committed golden outputs, all in mm (G71). One question per file:\n\n| # | File | Where | Question |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | drill_peck | station | #3102 was fixed by PR #3118: `Q208` is now a feed, not `FMAX`. Does `N100 G205` load and Test Run to the end now? |\n| 2 | drill_plate | station | Untested so far: **Cycle 200** (plain drilling). Does it load and run to the end? |\n| 3 | ream | station | Untested so far: **G247 Q339=1** (preset selection) at the start, then reaming as feed-in/feed-out moves. Does the control accept the G247 block? |\n| 4 | pocket_zigzag_plate_with_island | **Fehlmann** (340490-03), when you are next at it | The pocket output has changed since your run and is now 276 blocks, over the demo station's 100-block limit. One continuous load + Test Run (or dry run) on the real control. If the graphics work there, does the cut look like a zigzag pocket around a central island? |\n\nFiles 1-3 fit the demo station. A pass/fail per file (and the block + message for any failure) is all we need; anything that fails becomes an issue against `heidenhain.cps`.\n\n<details><summary>drill_peck.H (17 lines)</summary>\n\n```\n%VMC_3-AXIS G71 *\nN10 ; SETUP: Setup1*\nN20 ; OPERATION: Drill1 - DRILL*\nN30 ; T4 6MM HSS DRILL - DRILL D6*\nN40 T4 G17 S1500*\nN50 M3*\nN60 M8*\nN70 G00 G40 G90 Z+6*\nN80 G00 X+20 Y+10*\nN90 G00 X+20 Y+10 Z+0*\nN100 G205 Q200=+0 Q201=-24 Q206=+60 Q202=+18 Q203=+0 Q204=+0 Q212=+0 Q205=+18 Q258=+0 Q259=+0 Q257=+18 Q256=+1 Q211=+0 Q379=+0 Q253=+60 Q208=+99999.999 Q395=+0*\nN110 G00 X+20 Y+10 Z+0 M99*\nN120 G00 X+20 Y+10 Z+6*\nN130 M9*\nN140 M5*\nN150 M2*\nN99999999 %VMC_3-AXIS G71 *\n```\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>drill_plate.H (22 lines)</summary>\n\n```\n%VMC_3-AXIS G71 *\nN10 ; SETUP: Setup1*\nN20 ; OPERATION: Drill1 - DRILL*\nN30 ; T4 6MM HSS DRILL - DRILL D6*\nN40 T4 G17 S1500*\nN50 M3*\nN60 M8*\nN70 G00 G40 G90 Z+5*\nN80 G00 X+10 Y+10*\nN90 G00 X+10 Y+10 Z+0*\nN100 G200 Q200=+0 Q201=-5 Q206=+60 Q202=+5 Q210=+0 Q203=+0 Q204=+0 Q211=+0 Q395=+0*\nN110 G00 X+10 Y+10 Z+0 M99*\nN120 G00 X+10 Y+10 Z+5*\nN130 G00 X+30 Y+10 Z+5*\nN140 G00 X+30 Y+10 Z+0*\nN150 G200 Q200=+0 Q201=-3 Q206=+60 Q202=+3 Q210=+0 Q203=+0 Q204=+0 Q211=+0 Q395=+0*\nN160 G00 X+30 Y+10 Z+0 M99*\nN170 G00 X+30 Y+10 Z+5*\nN180 M9*\nN190 M5*\nN200 M2*\nN99999999 %VMC_3-AXIS G71 *\n```\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>ream.H (22 lines; the test file's comment line above the % header is left out)</summary>\n\n```\n%VMC_3-AXIS G71 *\nN10 ; OPERATION: Ream*\nN20 G247 Q339=1*\nN30 ; T3 REAMER 8H7 - D8*\nN40 T3 G17 S400*\nN50 M3*\nN60 M8*\nN70 G00 G40 G90 Z+10*\nN80 G00 X+10 Y+10*\nN90 G00 X+10 Y+10 Z+2*\nN100 G01 X+10 Y+10 Z-12 F150*\nN110 G01 X+10 Y+10 Z+2 F150*\nN120 G00 X+10 Y+10 Z+10*\nN130 G00 X+30 Y+10 Z+10*\nN140 G00 X+30 Y+10 Z+2*\nN150 G01 X+30 Y+10 Z-12 F150*\nN160 G01 X+30 Y+10 Z+2 F150*\nN170 G00 X+30 Y+10 Z+10*\nN180 M9*\nN190 M5*\nN200 M2*\nN99999999 %VMC_3-AXIS G71 *\n```\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>pocket_zigzag_plate_with_island.H (276 lines)</summary>\n\n```\n%VMC_3-AXIS G71 *\nN10 ; SETUP: Setup1*\nN20 ; OPERATION: Pocket1 - POCKET*\nN30 ; T3 8MM 3FL END MILL - FLAT END MILL D8*\nN40 T3 G17 S5000*\nN50 M3*\nN60 M8*\nN70 G00 G40 G90 Z+5*\nN80 G00 X+4.51 Y+4.61 Z+5*\nN90 G00 X+4.51 Y+4.61 Z+2*\nN100 G01 X+4.51 Y+4.61 Z-2 F80*\nN110 G01 X+4.01 Y+4.01 Z-2 F400*\nN120 G01 X+25.99 Y+4.01 Z-2 F400*\nN130 G01 X+25.99 Y+7.01 Z-2 F400*\nN140 G01 X+22.665 Y+7.01 Z-2 F400*\nN150 G00 X+22.665 Y+7.01 Z+5*\nN160 G00 X+7.334 Y+7.01 Z+5*\nN170 G00 X+7.334 Y+7.01 Z+2*\nN180 G01 X+7.334 Y+7.01 Z-2 F80*\nN190 G01 X+4.01 Y+7.01 Z-2 F400*\nN200 G01 X+4.01 Y+10.01 Z-2 F400*\nN210 G01 X+5.99 Y+10.01 Z-2 F400*\nN220 G00 X+5.99 Y+10.01 Z+5*\nN230 G00 X+24.01 Y+10.01 Z+5*\nN240 G00 X+24.01 Y+10.01 Z+2*\nN250 G01 X+24.01 Y+10.01 Z-2 F80*\nN